116 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 99 0 R
/E (  To protect and contain the water system safely, we will supply ourselves with water from the St. Car River system. As mentioned previously, Mt. Neverest, a mountain in northern Carzanart, contains a waterfall that provides more than enough water for residents and tourists. To tackle the problem of water, we have created the West Carzanart Water Tower to store and preserve our freshwater. To maximize the economy, water exports will be transported along the St. Car river. As a sustainable and smart city, we rely on hydro power to provide electricity renewably. We will keep the river fresh and pure by educating residents on proper waste disposal. We will also reduce pollution by having fines in place. We will also use drainage filters in sewer systems to add another layer of protection to keep the water clean. To prevent erosion in the river, we will add vegetation to bind soil from falling into the river. In order to prevent floods from the river and lake, we will use storm drains and position our residential areas on higher ground.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [1]
