121 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 101 0 R
/E ( On top of the vegetation in an urban setting, Carzanart has a beautiful tourist section, as stated earlier. This tourist destination is an ecosystem consisting of beautiful Mt. Neverest and forest surroundings. We fight for wildlife to have a habitat. We protect by preventing deforestation and soil erosion, and do so by having check-ups from the World Wide Fund for Wildlife\(WWF\), Green Belt, and the Region of Carzanart to leave old trees untouched. )
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
122 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
