/P 103 0 R
/E ( We learned that geography helps people make better decisions by understanding how the slightest miscalculations can lead to urban sprawl. We also learned that not only precision was key but building design was also a huge factor. Including white buildings with green roofs made our model a more eye-catching model in comparison to yellow buildings. )
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [3]
>>
