/E ( The biggest challenge in designing our city was proportionality and road structure. We tackled this issue by virtually designing our city on a Windows app known as Inkscape and color printing slices out at Staples. In order to fix proportionality we measured the board and added 3D prints according to the proportionality ratio of 1:2250.  )
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [5]
>>
